<title>FRANCE: Valeo block trade cancelled.</title>
<headline>Valeo block trade cancelled.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>A block trade of 1.06 million Valeo shares was cancelled following a mistake on the share price, the SBF French stock exchanges association said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>An initial trade for the shares done at 316.5 francs per share at 0940 GMT was cancelled and executed at 317.20 francs at 0952 GMT.</p>
<p>Taking into account an earlier block of 850,000 Valeo shares traded, a total of 1.92 million shares, or 2.7 percent of the capital has changed hands this morning.</p>
</text>
